# Copy to .env.local for local development (`npm run dev`), and add the same
# variables in Cloudflare → Workers & Pages → thediadem → Settings → Variables and Secrets
# (type: Secret, for both Production and Preview).

# --- Server only (used by functions/api/contact.ts). Never prefix these with VITE_. ---
# GoHighLevel → Settings → Private Integrations → token with
# "View Contacts" and "Edit Contacts" scopes
GHL_API_TOKEN=
# Sub-account (location) ID, from the GoHighLevel URL: /v2/location/<ID>/...
GHL_LOCATION_ID=8WJ6nyFWjFzTgnujES0n
# Optional: extra comma-separated tags added to every website lead
# GHL_TAGS=website-lead

# --- Browser (optional) ---
# Override where the contact form posts. Defaults to /api/contact.
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
# Optional: a chat backend for the floating assistant (POST { messages } and reply { reply }).
# Leave empty and it answers from the FAQs and services already on the site.
# VITE_ASSISTANT_ENDPOINT=
